#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:127
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Lista de verificación de migración"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:129
msgid "For a clean port to v4.1.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Para un porte limpio a v4.1.0 el trabajo habitual es:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:131
msgid ""
"Port NINA/RP2 WiFi code to the standard :class:`network.WLAN` interface "
"(``WLAN(interface)``, ``active()``, ``essid=``) and expect a tuple from "
"``nina.fw_version()`` (:ref:`the WiFi API change <v4_1_0_wifi>`)."
msgstr ""
"Porte el código WiFi de NINA/RP2 a la interfaz estándar "
":class:`network.WLAN` (``WLAN(interface)``, ``active()``, ``essid=``) y "
"espere una tupla de ``nina.fw_version()`` (:ref:`el cambio de la API de WiFi"
" <v4_1_0_wifi>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:134
msgid ""
"Change ``except ValueError`` to ``except RuntimeError`` around camera / "
":func:`sensor.reset` error handling (:ref:`the sensor-error change "
"<v4_1_0_errors>`)."
msgstr ""
"Cambie ``except ValueError`` por ``except RuntimeError`` en el manejo de "
"errores de la cámara / :func:`sensor.reset` (:ref:`el cambio de errores de "
"sensor <v4_1_0_errors>`)."
